urns, C.\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Basart, S.\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Zou, A.\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Mazeika, M.\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Song, D.\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Steinhardt, J.\\\\\\\"]\\\\n    year: 2021\\\\n    venue: \\\\\\\"ICLR 2021\\\\\\\"\\\\n    url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2009.03300\\\\\\\"\\\\n    doi: \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n    bibtex_key: hendrycks2021mmlu\\\\n    category: llm-evaluation-infrastructure\\\\n    role: foundation\\\\n    relevance: \\\\\\\"Introduced MMLU — the most widely used LLM benchmark with 57 tasks. Our contamination detection framework is primarily validated on MMLU-derived item parameters.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    abstract: \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n    semantic_scholar_id: \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n    verified: true\\\\n    added_by: worker\\\\n    added_at: \\\\\\\"2026-05-20T22:30:00Z\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  beeching2023openllm:\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"Open LLM Leaderboard\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: [\\\\\\\"Beeching, E.\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Fourrier, C.\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Habib, N.\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Han, S.\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Lambert, N.\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Rajani, N.\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Sanseviero, O.\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Tunstall, L.\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Wolf, T.\\\\\\\"]\\\\n    year: 2023\\\\n    venue: \\\\\\\"HuggingFace\\\\\\\"\\\\n    url: \\\\\\\"https://huggingface.co/spaces/open-llm-leaderboard-old/open_llm_leaderboard\\\\\\\"\\\\n    doi: \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n    bibtex_key: beeching2023openllm\\\\n    category: llm-evaluation-infrastructure\\\\n    role: foundation\\\\n    relevance: \\\\\\\"The primary public LLM leaderboard aggregating benchmark scores — the ecosystem where contamination incentives are strongest and our method is most needed.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    abstract: \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n    semantic_scholar_id: \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n    verified: true\\\\n    added_by: worker\\\\n    added_at: \\\\\\\"2026-05-20T22:30:00Z\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  gao2023evalharness:\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"A Framework for Few-Shot Language Model Evaluation\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: [\\\\\\\"Gao, L.\\\\\\\"