{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01S7B6zuaJtdnXT3zAhPvfTV","type":"tool_result","content":"16:This effect is model-dependent: Llama-3.1-8B shows near-monotonic free-$\\theta$ dose-response (ratio 1.09) due to lower baseline misfit ($\\ell_z^*{=}0.85$ versus Qwen's 8.68).\n29:Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct confirms generalizability: $|\\text{Cohen's}\\;d|{=}2.95$ (15\\%) and $3.31$ (50\\%) ($n{=}3$ clean seeds, mean$\\,{=}\\,{-}0.14\\pm0.97$), with $|\\Delta\\ell_z^*|{=}3.84$ (15\\%) and $4.18$ (50\\%).\n30:Unlike Qwen, Llama exhibits monotonic Cohen's $d$ dose-response ($|d|$ increases from 2.95 to 3.31), consistent with its lower baseline misfit.\n36:$\\ell_z^*$ and HT both yield large effect sizes ($|d| > 2.9$); U3 is inconsistent across families ($d{=}{-}0.43$ on Qwen vs.\\ ${-}3.69$ on Llama).\n52:Method & Info required & Qwen $d$ & Llama $d$ \\\\"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01DYzUhCfVJp3yaLssVHteYa","session_id":"44a048b4-6a0e-498e-861e-50d9d8212329","uuid":"dc515ea6-118d-447c-9819-4e931cd4b2e9","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:34:29.217Z"}
