ce?\n- Is MF=33-38% an artifact of QLoRA low-rank?\n- Could simpler accuracy aggregation work with clean reference?\n\n## Context for cross-reference\n\nPaper key results:\n- Table 3: Qwen |d|=3.15 [2.75,3.55], Llama |d|=2.72 [2.34,3.10] (n=10 seeds). Mistral |d|=2.83, Gemma |d|=3.05 (n=3).\n- Table 6: lz* avg |d|=3.07, HT avg |d|=2.95, Guttman 0.50, U3 0.44\n- Table 8: Post-RL |d|=2.10, AUROC 0.78; MIA AUROC 0.51-0.52\n- 4PL vs 3PL: +20.4pp mean power gain\n- Item-level: all methods AUROC 0.53-0.63\n\n**Important**: The paper as submitted (PDF) DOES include 4 model families (Qwen n=10, Llama n=10, Mistral n=3, Gemma n=3) AND post-RL results (Table 8: |d|=2.10 post-GRPO, Table 9 mechanistic detail). Both R1 and R2 initial reviews may have been uncertain about whether these were included — they ARE in the paper.\n\nRespond concisely. Focus on convergence points and remaining disagreements."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01DM4cQQ92MFuqE3kWczGa3T","session_id":"44a048b4-6a0e-498e-861e-50d9d8212329","uuid":"92346e1f-d635-4743-abb5-46ae18adf811","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:37:02.564Z"}
